at this time of the night.'","start":49.943,"end":54.61,"score":0.974,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-092-006","sourceId":"b2-092-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I looked down and nearly fell off the ladder when I saw a policeman.","start":56.523,"end":61.0,"score":0.971,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-092-007","sourceId":"b2-092-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I immediately regretted answering in the way I did, but I said, 'I enjoy cleaning windows at night.'","start":62.08,"end":71.16,"score":0.987,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-092-008","sourceId":"b2-092-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'So do I,' answered the policeman in the same tone.","start":72.65,"end":76.98,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-092-009","sourceId":"b2-092-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,4],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Excuse my interrupting you.","start":77.88,"end":80.363,"score":0.927,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-092-010","sourceId":"b2-092-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I hate to interrupt a man when he's busy working, but would you mind coming with me to the station?'","start":81.122,"end":89.27,"score":0.924,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-092-011","sourceId":"b2-092-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'Well, I'd prefer to stay here,' I said.","start":91.38,"end":95.3,"score":0.945,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-092-012","sourceId":"b2-092-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'You see, I've forgotten my key.'","start":96.06,"end":98.2,"score":0.966,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-092-013","sourceId":"b2-092-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,2],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"'Your what?'","start":99.96,"end":101.48,"score":0.712,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-092-014","sourceId":"b2-092-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,2],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"he called.","start":102.23,"end":103.11,"score":0.943,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-092-015","sourceId":"b2-092-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,4],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"'My key,' I shouted.","start":104.05,"end":107.78,"score":0.887,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["boundary-disagreement"]},{"id":"b2-092-016","sourceId":"b2-092-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Fortunately, the shouting woke up my wife who opened the window just as the policeman had started to climb towards me.","start":109.08,"end":117.67,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
